data modify storage bittersweet:almanac book.pages append value "\
§3§lVenomous Stalkers\n\n\
§0Cave spiders are exceptionally quick creatures, though their exoskeletons are even more fragile than their larger cousins. \
They appear to have sacrificed strength for speed and venom, making them dangerous foes for—"
data modify storage bittersweet:almanac book.pages append value "\
the ill-prepared. Their dark exterior allows them to camoflage in the dark. Combined with their long legs and ability to climb, \
they are very much cave predators. They often prey on bats, but aren't picky eaters."
data modify storage bittersweet:almanac book.pages append value "\
Upon pouncing on their prey, cave spiders deliver a surprisingly weak wound, but their venom is considerably more potent. \
The effects are initially severe, gradually mellowing out as the toxin is broken down by the body."
